            <ArticleTitle>Lymphangioma of the falciform ligament--a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1276-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A rare case of a lymphangioma of the falciform ligament in a child is described. He presented with abdominal pain and was found to have an unusual intraabdominal mass. Resection was curative.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
